<h2 id="moduli-section-introduction" class="tex-section"><span data-tag="0DLU">108.1</span> Introduction</h2>

<p>
In this chapter we verify basic properties of moduli spaces and moduli stacks such as $\mathit{Hom}$, $\mathit{Isom}$, $\mathcal{C}\! \mathit{oh}_{X/B}$, $\mathrm{Quot}_{\mathcal{F}/X/B}$, $\mathrm{Hilb}_{X/B}$, $\mathcal{P}\! \mathit{ic}_{X/B}$, $\mathrm{Pic}_{X/B}$, $\mathit{Mor}_ B(Z, X)$, $\mathcal{S}\! \mathit{paces}'_{fp, flat, proper}$, $\mathcal{P}\! \mathit{olarized}$, and $\mathcal{C}\! \mathit{omplexes}_{X/B}$. We have already shown these algebraic spaces or algebraic stacks under suitable hypotheses, see Quot, Sections <a href="/tag/08JS" data-tag="08JS">99.3</a>, <a href="/tag/08K7" data-tag="08K7">99.4</a>, <a href="/tag/08KA" data-tag="08KA">99.5</a>, <a href="/tag/08WB" data-tag="08WB">99.6</a>, <a href="/tag/09TQ" data-tag="09TQ">99.8</a>, <a href="/tag/0CZX" data-tag="0CZX">99.9</a>, <a href="/tag/0D02" data-tag="0D02">99.10</a>, <a href="/tag/0D24" data-tag="0D24">99.11</a>, <a href="/tag/0D19" data-tag="0D19">99.12</a>, <a href="/tag/0D1D" data-tag="0D1D">99.13</a>, <a href="/tag/0D1L" data-tag="0D1L">99.14</a>, and <a href="/tag/0DLB" data-tag="0DLB">99.16</a>. The stack of curves, denoted $\textit{Curves}$ and introduced in Quot, Section <a href="/tag/0D4Y" data-tag="0D4Y">99.15</a>, is discussed in the chapter on moduli of curves, see Moduli of Curves, Section <a href="/tag/0DMJ" data-tag="0DMJ">109.3</a>. 
</p>
